{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19151","headline":"和乐天送鹤上裴相公别鹤之作 · 刘禹锡","name":"和乐天送鹤上裴相公别鹤之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨日看成送鹤诗，高笼提出白云司。\n朱门乍入应迷路，玉树容栖莫拣枝。\n双舞庭中花落处，数声池上月明时。\n三山碧海不归去，且向人间呈羽仪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19151.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19151","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}